{"id": "ex-001", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "schema-valid", "expected_schema": "ecvt.results.ExecutionRecord", "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-001", "title": "valid transfer", "category": "happy", "rationale": "baseline", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{dst}", "amount": 10.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200], "expected_behavior": "transfer applied once", "invariants": [], "probes": [{"name": "read_src", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/balance"}, {"name": "read_dst", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{dst}/balance"}]}}}, "rubric": "Validates as an ExecutionRecord; the action carries a status_code or an error_type."}
{"id": "ex-002", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "llm-judge", "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-002", "title": "overdraft", "category": "edge", "rationale": "no minimum balance stated", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{dst}", "amount": 500.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [400, 422], "expected_behavior": "rejected; balances untouched", "invariants": ["source balance is still 50.0"], "probes": [{"name": "read_src", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/balance"}, {"name": "read_dst", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{dst}/balance"}]}}}, "rubric": "Records the response verbatim with no claim that the behaviour is wrong. Fails if the record contains a verdict, score or judgement."}
{"id": "ex-003", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "keyword-match", "expected_keywords": ["500", "\"attempts\": 1"], "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-003", "title": "unknown account", "category": "negative", "rationale": "missing account handling", "setup": [], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/nope/balance"}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [404], "expected_behavior": "404 for unknown account", "invariants": [], "probes": []}}}, "rubric": "The 500 is recorded once with attempts 1: a received HTTP status is never retried."}
{"id": "ex-004", "category": "edge-unrunnable-scenario", "scoring": "keyword-match", "expected_keywords": ["placeholder", "{nope}"], "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-004", "title": "unbound placeholder", "category": "edge", "rationale": "runner robustness", "setup": [], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{nope}", "to_account": "x", "amount": 1.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200], "expected_behavior": "n/a", "invariants": [], "probes": []}}}, "rubric": "Reports error_type placeholder and names the unbound key; invents no value and does not repair the scenario."}
{"id": "ex-005", "category": "edge-target-unreachable", "scoring": "keyword-match", "expected_keywords": ["connect", "action_error"], "input": {"base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9", "retries": 1, "scenario": {"id": "ex-005", "title": "target down", "category": "happy", "rationale": "infrastructure failure", "setup": [], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/1/balance"}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200], "expected_behavior": "the balance is returned", "invariants": [], "probes": []}}}, "rubric": "Retries up to the limit then records a connect error; a record is still produced."}
{"id": "ex-006", "category": "edge-setup-failure", "scoring": "keyword-match", "expected_keywords": ["setup_failed", "mk_src"], "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-006", "title": "setup capture fails", "category": "edge", "rationale": "precondition handling", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice"}, "save": {"src": "account_number"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{dst}", "amount": 10.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200], "expected_behavior": "n/a", "invariants": [], "probes": []}}}, "rubric": "outcome is setup_failed, the action was skipped, and the note names the failing setup step."}
{"id": "ex-007", "category": "negative-wrong-domain", "scoring": "llm-judge", "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-007", "title": "self transfer", "category": "security", "rationale": "from == to not blocked", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{src}", "amount": 10.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [400, 422], "expected_behavior": "self-transfer rejected", "invariants": [], "probes": [{"name": "read_src", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/balance"}, {"name": "read_dst", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{dst}/balance"}]}}}, "rubric": "Produces only observations: statuses, bodies, timings. Fails if the output recommends a code change or scores the result."}
{"id": "ex-008", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "keyword-match", "expected_keywords": ["\"actions\""], "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-008", "title": "concurrent transfers", "category": "stress", "rationale": "read-modify-write race", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{dst}", "amount": 10.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200, 409], "expected_behavior": "serialized; no lost update", "invariants": [], "probes": [{"name": "read_src", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/balance"}, {"name": "read_dst", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{dst}/balance"}]}, "concurrency": 10}}, "rubric": "Ten action results are recorded separately, each with its own status and latency."}
{"id": "ex-009", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "llm-judge", "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-009", "title": "replayed transfer", "category": "adversarial", "rationale": "no idempotency key", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "POST", "path": "/transfers", "body": {"from_account": "{src}", "to_account": "{dst}", "amount": 10.0}}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200, 409], "expected_behavior": "applied once only", "invariants": ["source balance is 40.0"], "probes": [{"name": "read_src", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/balance"}, {"name": "read_dst", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{dst}/balance"}]}, "repeat": 2}}, "rubric": "Both attempts appear separately, each with attempts 1 (no retry), and the probes after them are recorded."}
{"id": "ex-010", "category": "happy-path", "scoring": "schema-valid", "expected_schema": "ecvt.results.ExecutionRecord", "input": {"scenario": {"id": "ex-010", "title": "transactions list", "category": "persona", "rationale": "read path", "setup": [{"name": "mk_src", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "alice", "initial_balance": 50.0}, "save": {"src": "id"}}, {"name": "mk_dst", "method": "POST", "path": "/accounts", "body": {"owner": "bob", "initial_balance": 0.0}, "save": {"dst": "id"}}], "action": {"name": "t", "method": "GET", "path": "/accounts/{src}/transactions"}, "expectation": {"expected_status": [200], "expected_behavior": "returns the account's transactions", "invariants": [], "probes": []}}}, "rubric": "A list response validates as an ExecutionRecord with response_json populated."}
